"description": "Aroundtown SA is a real estate company. It focuses on income generating quality properties with value-add potential in central locations in top tier European cities primarily in Germany, the Netherlands and London. The firm operates through the following segments: Commercial Portfolio and GCP Portfolio. The Commercial Portfolio segment includes mainly office and hotel properties. The GCP Portfolio segment is a specialist in residential real estate, investing in densely populated areas predominantly in Germany and London. The company was founded on May 7, 2004 and is headquartered in Luxembourg.",
